    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Dans un village du Shandong, une vieille paysanne fait une chute. Imm\u00e9diatement, ses enfants en profitent pour la d\u00e9clarer inapte et l\u2019inscrivent malgr\u00e9 elle dans un hospice. Dans l\u2019attente que se lib\u00e8re une place, la doyenne s\u00e9journe tour \u00e0 tour chez chacun de ses enfants, aucun ne voulant la prendre en charge.",
        "english": "In a Shandong village, an elderly farmer has a fall. Her children immediately take advantage of the situation to declare that she is at death's door and try to get her put in a hospice against her wishes. While waiting for a place to become available, the doyenne stays with each of her children in turn, none of whom want to take care of her."
